  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large cazuela over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and garlic and sauté until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add brine shrimp and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add fish sauce, soy sauce, tamarind paste, and ginger, and stir to combine.",
    "Add samphire and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes, or until samphire is tender.",
    "Stir in kaffir lime leaves and serve hot."
